    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Good Boy is fast and relentless, so timing is crucial.\nSearch the map for <color=#ff0510>pieces of meat</color> — throwing one in front of him will distract him for a short time, giving you a chance to escape."
