    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: Scattered around the map are <color=#ff0510>four types of potions</color>. Drinking a potion causes negative effects at first - but if you drink another potion while the negative effect is still active, you will gain very <color=#ff0510>powerful positive bonuses</color> instead. You can find <color=#ff0510>hints on the walls</color> that reveal what effects different potion combinations will grant.
