    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "In the haunted school, the game alternates between <color=#ff0510>lesson and break cycles</color>.\nDuring lessons, classroom doors are closed and safe — but during breaks, doors open and <color=#ff0510>an enemy can enter the rooms</color>."
