    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Avoid Krasue and stay alert - she hunts relentlessly through the mansion.\nRooms are <b>safe zones</b>, so use them to hide and plan your next move.\nUse the Eyes to <color=#ff0510>see through the monster’s vision</color> and track her position.\nCollect the required bags, then find the exit and escape before she catches you."
